+# Aegis Architecture (high-level)
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart LR
+  subgraph Ingest
+    A[Dask Ingest] --> B[Processed Manifests]
+  end
+  subgraph Training
+    B --> C[FL Controller / Trainer]
+    C --> D[Per-shard DP Accounting]
+  end
+  subgraph ControlPlane
+    E[OPA Policy / MOFN] --> C
+    F[Safety Monitor] --> C
+    G[Self-healing Controller] --> C
+    H[Evidence Chain: cosign -> S3 -> Rekor] --> I[Auditor Proof Bundles]
+  end
+  subgraph Infra
+    J[Rekor] & K[Vault+CSI] & L[Prometheus/Grafana] --> ControlPlane
+    M[gRPC DP / Evidence services] --> ControlPlane
+  end
+  C --> H
+  I --> Compliance[Compliance & Auditors]
+```
+
+## Narrative
+
+- Ingest: Dask workers and preprocessing produce processed manifests used for training and evaluation.
+- Training: Federated/central training processes use DP preflight checks per modality (image/text), and call the FL controller which interacts with OPA for policy decisions.
+- Control plane: OPA decides which operations are autonomous vs gated; safety_monitor enforces runtime invariants and records signed manifests. Self-healing controller executes promotions, probes post-actions, and rolls back on failures.
+- Evidence chain: every autonomous action emits artifacts signed with cosign, uploaded to your evidence S3, and registered with Rekor for immutable, auditable timestamps. Formal artifacts (Z3, TLA+/Apalache) are collected into auditor bundles.
+- Infra: Rekor, Vault+CSI, Prometheus/Grafana run in your tenancy (self-hosted) and integrate with the control plane. Optional gRPC services provide low-latency DP and evidence endpoints.
+
+Use this diagram and narrative in governance briefs and auditor handoffs.
+
